## Scope
Skills are on-demand expertise. `name` must match the folder that contains `SKILL.md`.

## Two kinds
- **Tech** (`<topic>-v<major>/`, e.g. `fastify-v5`): agent-invocable. Required sections: Scope, Assumptions, Principles, Constraints, Interactions
- **Workflow** (`workflow/<name>/`): slash-only. Set `disable-model-invocation: true`. One-line `description`. Not versioned

## Principles
- One primary topic per skill; independent versions = separate skills
- `name` lowercase/digits/hyphens, max 64, equals folder name
- Prefer `paths` over legacy `globs` when file-scoped
- Declarative: state what is true. Patterns over long examples
- Progressive disclosure: keep `SKILL.md` short; depth in `references/` or `PATTERNS.md`
- No repo-specific paths in tech skills. Rules override skills
- Workflow descriptions stay one line (discovery tokens are always-on)

## Hierarchy
Rules (constraints) > skills (patterns) > model
